in on some of the fruits

00:18:24.078 --> 00:18:26.198
of this amazing hard work.

00:18:26.198 --> 00:18:28.374
It's a little bit more exciting to dress

00:18:28.374 --> 00:18:29.928
a little bit better, to
live at a better place,

00:18:29.928 --> 00:18:31.566
to take a vacation, to
do all these things.

00:18:31.566 --> 00:18:32.780
I get it.

00:18:32.780 --> 00:18:34.921
The way to scale and grow
is to have the dollars

00:18:34.921 --> 00:18:36.507
to continue to scale and grow.

00:18:36.507 --> 00:18:38.020
If you're doing everything yourself,

00:18:38.020 --> 00:18:39.043
there's a couple reasons.

00:18:39.043 --> 00:18:41.041
One, you're a perfectionist
and don't think

00:18:41.041 --> 00:18:42.030
anybody else can do it.

00:18:42.030 --> 00:18:43.624
Two, you see other people do it

00:18:43.624 --> 00:18:45.834
and they do it as an eight to your 10,

00:18:45.834 --> 00:18:46.691
and that's not good enough.

00:18:46.691 --> 00:18:48.817
Three, you do not want to
deploy the money because

00:18:48.817 --> 00:18:50.331
you want to use those
monies for other things

00:18:50.331 --> 00:18:51.559
for yourselves and other things.

00:18:51.559 --> 00:18:54.585
All three are massive vulnerabilities.

00:18:54.585 --> 00:18:56.418
Fix those three, and you'll grow.

00:18:56.418 --> 00:18:58.035
I run my businesses the first five,

00:18:58.035 --> 00:19:00.949
10 years of their lives at no profit.

00:19:00.949 --> 00:19:03.279
