employees 10 times more.

00:19:39.440 --> 00:19:41.492
Biggest mistake entrepreneurs make,

00:19:41.492 --> 00:19:43.088
they treat their employees worse than

00:19:43.088 --> 00:19:44.634
they treat their customers.

00:19:44.634 --> 00:19:45.852
Biggest mistake.

00:19:45.852 --> 00:19:48.147
